solution:
def decoupled_loss(behaviour, proximal, current, advantage, cap=2):
    w=min(cap,proximal/behaviour)
    ratio=current/proximal
    clipped=min(1.2,max(.8,ratio))
    return -w*min(ratio*advantage,clipped*advantage)

